# Reflexive object properties added where meaningful across the ontology.
# New triples only are provided below, in valid Turtle syntax.

@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix : <http://example.org/ontology#> .

:isSimilarTo a owl:ReflexiveProperty .
:isEquivalentTo a owl:ReflexiveProperty .
:isRelatedTo a owl:ReflexiveProperty .